# Given: a keyring entry for the inner call and the fixture key
# When: the outer gcm_decrypt is given four arguments, so its init fails
# Then: an argument-count error, and the after block records whether gcm uninstalls
--- errors, in statement order ---
ERROR 1123 (HY000) at line 12: Can't initialize function 'gcm_decrypt'; gcm_decrypt(ciphertext, key [, aad]) needs 2 or 3 arguments
--- after the case ---
probe_counts: {"probe_outer":{"init":0,"deinit":0},"probe_raise_const":{"init":0,"deinit":0},"probe_raise_volatile":{"init":0,"deinit":0}}
uninstall gcm: ok
install gcm: ok
